                         "name":"jsonFile",
                         "type":"string",
                         "value":"A sign was put here. I wonder by who?~It says: Lake Clayfall is not a native water source. Several years ago, an earthquake tore down some of the clay walls to the north.~This event caused water from the Farnor river to flood into the badlands. One day, the water will fully evaporate again, leaving the badlands dried out again."
